9/"}], "flavor_text_entries": [{"flavor_text": "It beats its wings together to create fire.\nAs it moves in the steps of its beautiful dance,\nit bathes opponents in intense flames.", "language": {"name": "en", "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"}, "version": {"name": "sun", "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/27/"}}, {"flavor_text": "This Oricorio has sipped red nectar. Its\npassionate dance moves cause its enemies\nto combust in both body and mind.", "language": {"name": "en", "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"}, "version": {"name": "moon", "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/28/"}}, {"flavor_text": "It wins the hearts of its enemies with its\npassionate dancing and then uses the opening\nit creates to burn them up with blazing flames.", "language": {"name": "en", "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"}, "version": {"name": "ultra-sun", "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/29/"}}, {"flavor_text": "This Oricorio has drunk red nectar. If its Trainer\ngives the wrong order, this passionate Pok\u00e9mon\nbecomes fiercely angry.", "language": {"name": "en", "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"}, "version": {"name": "ultra-moon", "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/30/"}}]}